SDV test1:
VSS :
    Sensor Signal Camera (SSP:10+/-2ms, DL: 5+/-2ms)
    Sensor Signal Lidar (SSP:10+/-2ms, DL: 5+/-2ms) 

    Actuator Signal FrontBrake (periodic 10+/-2ms, AD: 5+/-2ms)
    Actuator Signal RearBrake (periodic 10+/-2ms, AD: 5+/-2ms)
 
App :
    Component AEBS_controler 
        subscribe to VSS signal Camera  
        subscribe to VSS signal Lidar (Rad)
 
        publish to VSS signal FrontBrake (FB)
        publish Alarm
        service s1:
            triggered on Rad 
            ExecTime 3+/-1ms 

    Component SecondControler 
        subscribe to Alarm (Al)
        publish to VSS signal RearBrake 
        service s2:
            periodic 10+/-1ms
            ExecTime 3+/-1ms
        // service s3:
        //     triggered on Al
        //     ExecTime 3+/-1ms

Functional Chains:
 chain : Lidar -> Rad -> s1 -> FB -> FrontBrake 